{"type": "result", "session_id": "20260930_154359_8800e0", "exit_code": 0, "text": "Email 1: Cloud-first efficiency, or total cost of ownership?\n\nMorgan,\n\nYour engineers already pay for cloud workstations. But every time connectivity fails on site, that bill still runs while productivity drops.\n\nAurora 14 runs AI models locally\u2014open-weight language models up to 30 billion parameters\u2014on the device. No cloud dependency. 14-inch OLED display, 120 Hz. 86 Wh battery, up to 11 hours local video playback.\n\nIf your team needs to run client drawings and simulation models on the go, a powerful local device reduces reliance on cloud uptime.\n\nReady to see how this fits your Q1 budget?\n\n[Reply to discuss your 2026 fleet needs]", "tokens": {"input": 847, "output": 158, "total": 4824, "cache_read": 3819, "cache_write": 0}, "duration_ms": 22337, "timestamp": 1790808262176}